    },
    {
      "Original": "Mark the 'ppm' option preview folders and their files with the system 'Hidden' attribute.\nThis hides them from Penumbra's 'File Redirections' tab to prevent UI clutter.\nNote: This will also hide the 'ppm' folders in Windows File Explorer unless you have 'Show hidden files' enabled.\nNormal end mod consumers do not need this; it is mostly useful for mod creators\nor users who edit file redirections directly.",
      "Context": "ConfigWindow.Draw",
      "PreserveID": false,
      "Role": "UI",
      "RoleReason": "→ ImGui.SetTooltip",
      "Translated": "为 'ppm' 选项预览文件夹及其中的文件设置系统“隐藏”属性。\n这些文件将从 Penumbra 的“文件重定向”页签中隐藏，减少列表干扰。\n注意：若未在 Windows 资源管理器中开启“显示隐藏的文件”，'ppm' 文件夹也会被隐藏。\n此选项主要适用于模组作者\n或直接编辑文件重定向的用户。",
      "Source": "library"
    },
